      "id": "salivary_pa_recurrence",
      "label": "Pleomorphic adenoma with breached capsule / satellites - re-excision advice",
      "auto": {
        "flag": "paRecurrenceRisk"
      },
      "text": "Complete excision with an adequate cuff of normal tissue is advised as the risk of recurrence is increased."
    },
    {
      "id": "salivary_igg4",
      "label": "IgG4-related sialadenitis - recommend IgG4/IgG immunostains and serum IgG4",
      "auto": {
        "field": "igg4",
        "truthy": true
      },
      "text": "The pattern of chronic sialadenitis ({parts}) raises the possibility of IgG4-related disease. IgG4 and IgG immunostains (IgG4-positive plasma cell count and IgG4/IgG ratio) and a serum IgG4 level are recommended for correlation."
    },
    {
      "id": "salivary_cancer_template",
      "label": "Malignant - report on the QMH salivary gland template",
      "auto": {
