      },
      "text": "A malignant salivary gland neoplasm is identified ({parts}). This benign template does not grade or stage the tumour; please complete the report using the QMH salivary gland template (WHO 5th edition tumour type, grade, size, extraparenchymal extension, perineural and lymphovascular invasion, margins and lymph node status)."
    }
